  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">DA+Riksantikvarie&#xe4;mbetet</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Depart of antiquities+NHB</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Den kapacitet builing Project till Department of Antiquities          (2004-2010) genomf&#xf6;rs i samarbete mellan regeringarna i Sverige och   Tanzania. Det syftar till att ge DA f&#xf6;r att det ska kunna bevara och  bevara materiella och immateriella kulturarv. Sidas bidrag till       projektet &#xe4;r MSEK 23,5. Genomf&#xf6;randet av projektet framg&#xe5;ngsrikt      gjort med de m&#xe5;l f&#xf6;rverkligas.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The Capacity Builing Project to the Department of Antiquities         (2004-2010) is implemented in partnership between the governments of  Sweden and Tanzania. It aims at empowering the DA for it to be able   to conserve and preserve tangible and intangible cultural heritages.  Sida&apos;s contribution to the project is MSEK 23.5. Implementation of    the project was successfully done with the objectives realized.</narrative>
  </description>
